daytona (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release (pre-release quality) of the Qt edition: the Daytona
    shell, the daytona Qt style, daytona-themetool, the labwc configuration
    and session, and Chicago95 built from its pinned submodule.
  * Taskbar with Start menu, window buttons, notification area (tray icons,
    volume, battery) and clock; notification balloons; desktop with NT
    wallpaper modes plus Fit and Fill.
  * Run, Shut Down (Stand by, Hibernate), Taskbar Properties, Display
    Properties (background, appearance, screen saver, settings) and Mouse
    Properties dialogs, and an NT-style Control Panel.
  * NT-style Workstation Locked screen, Blank Screen screen saver and idle
    lock through swayidle; volume and brightness keys.
  * XDG autostart through dex and LXQt's polkit agent in the session.
  * labwc with a small patch for NT's raised 3D window frames and pressed
    caption buttons, installed privately in /usr/libexec/daytona.

